{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/henchGIF.gif?t=1744421404\" /><strong>Cyborgs are hunting you down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/ShootingGifUpdate.gif?t=1744421404\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your smart pistol to fend them off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/CarGIF.gif?t=1744421404\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive your hover truck around a violent, bizarre city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/brunGIF.gif?t=1744421404\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chat it up with entertaining characters. Hang out in a mansion or a space ship.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong>: A disillusioned tech worker falls for a rebellious artist in a cyborg infested city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Puzzles &amp; Cryptic Messages</strong> \u2013 Uncover secret paths and decipher clues that pull you deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1744421404","background_raw":"https://stor